TIP:  The rhythm is a little tricky.  At the end of the line finish with a single strum and palm mute which will form the (NC) for the first word of the following line.

TIP:  Going into the instrumental if you can remember to play the final (A) with your bottom fingers it’ll make sliding up to the (B) on “Oh (B) yeah!”  For the (Asus4) just slide your bottom finger up one fret and then back down for the next (A).
   

